    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a decay model with no decay effect. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class models a situation where the value remains constant over time. It overrides the apply method to return the input value unchanged, effectively disabling any decay process. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
